(a) Non-profit organizations desiring to sell, provide, or allow alcoholic beverages (beer and wine only) at a special event may apply for and submit completed forms furnished by the commissioner of the state department of revenue for a temporary special event license in order to obtain a permit from the commissioner of the state department of revenue authorizing the organization to sell, distribute, or allow alcoholic beverages (beer and wine only) for consumption only on the premises, for a period not to exceed two days, which cannot include Christmas Day, and subject to the rules and regulations of the state department of revenue.
